---
import FinalFrontierLayout from "../layouts/FinalFrontierLayout.astro";
---
<FinalFrontierLayout title="About Mythadis">
  <section class="route-heading">
    <span class="hero-kicker">A MORE SKEPTICAL TOMORROW</span>
    <h1>INTERNET CLAIMS.<br /><em>ACTUAL EXPERIMENTS.</em></h1>
    <p>Mythadis investigates the things the internet promises. We test claims rather than simply react to them, then show what happened and the evidence behind it.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-band">
    <div class="editorial-copy">
      <h2>THE CLAIM. THE TEST. THE RECEIPTS.</h2>
      <p>An investigation starts with a specific claim. We ask whether it can be reproduced, describe how it was tested, and publish the observations and limitations alongside the verdict.</p>
      <h2>THE BS METER</h2>
      <p>The BS Meter is part of our editorial language. It makes our level of skepticism visible; it is not a probability or a substitute for evidence. Exceptional claims can push it past 10.</p>
      <p>This is working copy. The case files and scores in this preview are fictional examples.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="broadcast-panel">
      <h2>WATCH THERE.<br />FIND THE RECEIPTS HERE.</h2>
      <p>Long-form investigations will primarily appear on YouTube, with Rumble as a secondary destination. Mythadis.com is the canonical home for the investigation, its context and its evidence.</p>
      <a class="primary-cta" href="/evidence/">SHOW THE RECEIPTS →</a>
    </aside>
  </section>
</FinalFrontierLayout>
